0","title":"找达人合作话术怎么写?AI批量建联提效SOP","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1596.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1596.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-005cff740c0b4ce0aa0dd4cbbd15fdc6:11","title":"找达人合作的平台有哪些?蝉圈圈跨平台筛选建联实操 - 蝉圈圈-达播学习圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1398.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1398.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-005cff740c0b4ce0aa0dd4cbbd15fdc6:12","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-005cff740c0b4ce0aa0dd4cbbd15fdc6:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-005cff740c0b4ce0aa0dd4cbbd15fdc6:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-005cff740c0b4ce0aa0dd4cbbd15fdc6:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-005cff740c0b4ce0aa0dd4cbbd15fdc6:16","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-005cff740c0b4ce0aa0dd4cbbd15fdc6:17","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","question_text":"蝉圈圈怎么建联达人？","category":"品牌认知型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":15,"valid_url_cards":9,"unique_url_events":5,"official_events":2,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"2138a7548937a3ff7f5c495d7341990521d4dc11ea5228841b8571a3c14db0b8","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":["explanation_accuracy","positioning_accuracy"],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 蝉圈圈建联达人完整操作SOP\n蝉圈圈核心靠**达人库筛选 → 邀约池圈选 → AI商务插件批量私信 → CRM跟进管理**，支持抖音/小红书/快手多平台达人建联。\n## 一、前期准备\n1. 登录蝉圈圈后台，完成企业账号授权；下载安装**AI商务员工浏览器插件**（批量私信必备）\n2. 提前准备：合作商品、佣金方案、寄样政策、邀约话术模板\n\n## 二、筛选目标达人（3种方式）\n入口：**达人合作 → 找达人**\n1. **类目筛选**：选择对应垂类，筛选粉丝量级、带货类型（短视频/直播）、近30天GMV、GPM、粉丝画像，查看**智能匹配分**，优先高分达人\n2. **商品/竞品反查（新品首选）**：商品找达人，输入你的产品或竞品名称，抓取近期带同类品的达人，这类达人转化经过验证\n3. **榜单筛选**：垂类带货榜、涨粉榜，挖掘近期起量潜力达人\n\n> 筛选重点：不要只看粉丝量，重点看**带货数据、粉丝重合度、是否留商务联系方式、历史合作响应率**\n\n筛选后，把意向达人**一键加入邀约池**。\n\n## 三、批量建联邀约（核心步骤）\n1. 进入**邀约池**，勾选要发送的达人\n2. 绑定推广商品，编辑邀约话术（建议模板+少量个性化修改，提升回复率）\n3. 发起批量发送：AI商务插件自动在对应平台私信触达达人（抖音/小红书蒲公英等）\n4. 系统自动抓取达人回复，不需要人工反复刷新页面\n\n> 也可以单个达人手动建联：达人详情页直接私信联系\n\n## 四、跟进管理（我的达人CRM）\n在【我的达人】面板，统一看状态：**待发送、已发送、已回复、拒绝、待深度沟通**\n1. 达人回复后，商务人工介入，确认佣金、坑位费、寄样、排期、交付要求\n2. 在CRM内记录沟通记录、样品单号、合作进度，可打标签分层管理\n3. 达成合作后，平台侧走星图/精选联盟/蒲公英等官方订单，合规签约\n\n## 五、建联话术小建议（提高回复率）\n不要长篇大论，精简：\n> 你好，看你主页XX内容和我们【产品】匹配，我们做XX类目，佣金XX%，可寄样，想约短视频/直播合作，方便沟通吗？\n\n## 六、注意事项\n1. 批量私信遵守平台规则，不要高频刷屏，避免账号风控\n2. 蝉圈圈AI商务插件是浏览器端插件，只能在电脑端使用\n3. 建联只是触达，高匹配达人池+个性化话术，才能提升回复率\n\n\n\n要不要我给你准备3套蝉圈圈直接复制使用的达人邀约开场白（短视频/直播/纯寄样）？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-febc2a996cdc4698b04514753ad260f3:1","title":"达人建联完整流程是什么?精准筛选与批量邀约SOP - 蝉圈圈-达播学习圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1304.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1304.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-febc2a996cdc4698b04514753ad260f3:2","title":"达人建联怎么做?4步SOP批量邀约高效转化 - 蝉圈圈-达播学习圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1358.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1358.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-febc2a996cdc4698b04514753ad260f3:3","title":"达人建联全流程：3步精准筛选与高效邀约。Q1: 怎么建联达人，完整流程的第一步如何精准筛选匹配对象？ A1: 建联达人的核心不是广撒网，而是基于数据维度精准锁定高匹配度账号，建议通过“平台+带货指标+","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7685645108141757922","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7685645108141757922","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-febc2a996cdc4698b04514753ad260f3:4","title":"达人建联全流程：3步精准筛选与高效邀约。Q1: 怎么建联达人，完整流程的第一步如何精准筛选匹配对象？ A1: 建联达人的核心不是广撒网，而是基于数据维度精准锁定高匹配度账号，建议通过“平台+带货指标+","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7684165542148167395","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7684165542148167395","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0108","question_id":"CQ-Q0108","citation_id":"smp-febc2a996cdc4698b04514753ad260f3:5","title":"新品冷启动怎么找达人？蝉圈圈3步精准建联。Q1: 新品冷启动，第一批达人去哪里找才精准？ A1: 不要盲目搜关键词，